BLOCKED: no signal integrity severity control exists in the Rules dialog.

The Electrical rules tab (crates/ui-egui/src/project_settings/electrical.rs) only
exposes severity controls for the four electrical check codes in ELECTRICAL_CODES:
unassigned_pin, single_pin_net, pin_conflict, undriven_input. The signal integrity
check codes (impedance_target, return_path, parallel_crosstalk, stub_length) have
no severity row in the UI, so the e2e story cannot click a real control to change
their severity.
